## Project-local Visual Studio / .NET ignores

# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/

# User-specific Visual Studio files
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache

# Test output and coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# Packages and generated files
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

# SQL Server local database files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

# Secrets and local environment overrides
*.pfx
*.publishsettings
appsettings.Local.json
